31
03:29.000 --> 03:29.810
Issei.

32
03:29.829 --> 03:30.910
Issei.

33
03:39.180 --> 03:40.370
Ren.

34
03:42.340 --> 03:43.470
Ren.

35
03:46.650 --> 03:47.710
Ren.

36
03:48.200 --> 03:49.000
What the hell?

37
03:49.440 --> 03:50.750
