176
12:05.070 --> 12:08.290
-It laid the foundation for modern economics. -We're on the next page.

177
12:08.290 --> 12:10.700
-Adam Smith's The Wealth of Nations -Thank you.

178
12:10.700 --> 12:14.220
is an extremely valuable book

179
